msgid ""
"# 精度对齐指南\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Precision Alignment Guide\n"
""

msgid ""
"在 VeRL 框架中进行强化学习（RL）训练时，**精度对齐**是确保训练过程可复现、可调试的关键环节。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"When you perform reinforcement learning (RL) training in the VeRL framework, **precision alignment** is critical for ensuring a reproducible and debuggable training process.\n"
""

msgid ""
"本文档总结了在 VeRL 上对NPU和GPU进行精度对齐的方法以供参考。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"This document summarizes the methods for performing precision alignment for NPUs and GPUs in VeRL for reference.\n"
""

msgid ""
"## 1. 环境与权重对齐\n"
""
msgstr ""
"## 1. Environment and Weight Alignment\n"
""

msgid ""
"### 1.1 依赖版本对齐\n"
""
msgstr ""
"### 1.1 Dependency Version Alignment\n"
""

msgid ""
"VeRL、transformers版本需要进行强对齐，否则会直接影响精度结果。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"You must strictly align the versions of VeRL and transformers; otherwise, the precision results are directly affected.\n"
""

msgid ""
"其他关键依赖（torch、megatron、vllm）如无法进行强对齐，需优先保持一致或相近。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"If you cannot achieve strong alignment for other key dependencies (torch, megatron, vllm), prioritize keeping them consistent or similar.\n"
""

msgid ""
"### 1.2 模型权重对齐\n"
""
msgstr ""
"### 1.2 Model Weight Alignment\n"
""

msgid ""
"检查模型的权重和config.json文件是否完全一致\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Check whether the model weights and the config.json file are completely consistent.\n"
""

msgid ""
"## 2. 输入数据对齐\n"
""
msgstr ""
"## 2. Input Data Alignment\n"
""

msgid ""
"在verl训练启动脚本中添加如下配置：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Add the following configuration to the verl training startup script:\n"
""

msgid ""
"## 3. 配置对齐\n"
""
msgstr ""
"## 3. Configure Alignment\n"
""

msgid ""
"在NPU与GPU做精度对齐时，需检查配置是否完全对齐。包含：\n"
"1. 直接对比脚本写入配置\n"
"2. 运行过程中保存日志，收集日志打屏中的配置进行对比，可比较默认参数配置是否一致，需保证关键参数对齐\n"
""
msgstr ""
"When performing precision alignment between an NPU and a GPU, check whether the configurations are completely aligned. This includes:\n"
"1. Directly compare the configurations written by the script.\n"
"2. Save logs during the running process; collect the configurations from the console log output for comparison; verify the consistency of the default parameter configurations; and ensure that the key parameters are aligned.\n"
""

msgid ""
"## 4. 固定确定性\n"
""
msgstr ""
"## 4. Fixing Determinism\n"
""

msgid ""
